{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00316",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 4.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. Where would you like me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.18,
      "end_seconds": 11.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.76,
      "end_seconds": 19.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Um, so... hives. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.98,
      "end_seconds": 25.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Alright, is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.81,
      "end_seconds": 41.6,
      "duration_seconds": 15.79,
      "text": "It's been about two weeks, I'm fairly sure. And there's welts that move around as well, about a week now. With welts that move around, it's mild, honestly. It sort of comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.95,
      "end_seconds": 45.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Any joint pain or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.17,
      "end_seconds": 50.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Well, no joint pain or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.94,
      "end_seconds": 67.48,
      "duration_seconds": 15.54,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.79,
      "end_seconds": 69.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.14,
      "end_seconds": 73.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.32,
      "end_seconds": 77.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Yes, shellfish, it gives me hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.59,
      "end_seconds": 80.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Alright, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.48,
      "end_seconds": 85.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I mean, yes, I had my gallbladder removed, in 2016."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.86,
      "end_seconds": 93.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Alright, any long-term health problems I should know about? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.43,
      "end_seconds": 102.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "I've had asthma for five years now. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.0,
      "end_seconds": 122.62,
      "duration_seconds": 19.62,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known asthma. We'll keep that in mind today. Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.72,
      "end_seconds": 128.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.48,
      "end_seconds": 134.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.84,
      "end_seconds": 137.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.93,
      "end_seconds": 140.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Okay, do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.38,
      "end_seconds": 142.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.91,
      "end_seconds": 147.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.41,
      "end_seconds": 161.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.24,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.56,
      "end_seconds": 164.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "So, what medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.68,
      "end_seconds": 170.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Seretide inhaler, twice a day. Cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.66,
      "end_seconds": 175.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.89,
      "end_seconds": 177.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "My uncle had colon cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.29,
      "end_seconds": 181.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.72,
      "end_seconds": 196.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.41,
      "end_seconds": 224.82,
      "duration_seconds": 13.41,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 112 over 71, respiratory rate 14, temp 36.7 degrees, saturation 99 percent, heart rate 64. Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: I think we're dealing with acute urticaria, possibly allergic at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.89,
      "end_seconds": 227.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.51,
      "end_seconds": 243.82,
      "duration_seconds": 15.31,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now acute urticaria, possibly allergic is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had hives for about two weeks, and no fever or joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.29,
      "end_seconds": 247.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.46,
      "end_seconds": 272.1,
      "duration_seconds": 23.64,
      "text": "Let's get an allergy test, for recurrent urticaria. I'll start you on prednisolone, 20 milligrams, once a day, for three days. That should help with hives. Write down anything new you ate, took or used before this started, even small things. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.62,
      "end_seconds": 281.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if your lips or tongue swell more, or you have trouble breathing. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.95,
      "end_seconds": 282.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.8,
      "end_seconds": 291.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Let's review you in two weeks. Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.97,
      "end_seconds": 302.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "So, I take the prednisolone, 20 milligrams, once a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.23,
      "end_seconds": 307.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.55,
      "end_seconds": 310.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Hmm, thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.9,
      "end_seconds": 313.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}